      <div type="clause" n="14">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Cn1020">Cn 1020</ref> 14</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">For ðam þe ealle biscopas secgað þæt hit swyþe deop wið God to betanne þæt man aðas oððe wedd tobrece.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">For all the bishops declare that very severe amends must be made to God for the violation of oaths or pledges.</ab>
      </div>
